    "6:00 am in inn: Rita inspects the inn. The windowsill is unmarked. Phil says: Rita, I'm keeping the switcher here in the lobby. I'm locking in the 7 o'clock slot now. I need you to deliver the live report tonight. Phil spends the period at the inn.",
    "9:30 am in inn: Rita spends the period at the inn. Phil says: Morning, Rita. Just checking the room before I head out. Phil looks around. Rita invites Phil on the crew radio to contribute to the evening slot.",
    "1:00 pm in inn: Rita spends the period at the inn. Phil says: Rita, I have to run the 7 PM slot from here, but I've got a prior commitment to keep in Pittsburgh. I'm taking the one o'clock coach now. You'll have to handle the evening bulletin without my live input. Phil spends the period at the inn. Phil radios Rita and declined the evening assignment."
   ]
  },
